===Etymology 3===
{{zh-forms|alt=吃,𠋡-Eastern Min,呷-Southern Min,噍-Southern Min}}
{{zh-ref|Kwok (2018)}} reconstructs Proto-Southern Min {{m|nan||*tsiaʔ⁸}} and tentatively reconstructs {{cog|zhx-min-pro|*dziak}} (in Norman's system).

